description.narrative:
A household is a group of persons who observe the rules of living together in a single housing unit and have a common budget (its part) and comprising related and/or unrelated persons (a household may also be a  one-person household). The average monthly household income in rural areas, calculated as the average per household.  

Definition of "household income": GEOSTAT (https://www.geostat.ge/en/modules/categories/50/households-income);

Definition of a "household": LAW OF GEORGIA ON OFFICIAL STATISTICS, Article 3, Definition i) (Page 1).

